  "title": "Lemon Poppy Seed Muffins II",
  "description": "There &#39;s plenty of tart lemon in these glazed muffins -lemon yogurt, lemon zest and lemon juice all have a hand in heightening the citrus flavor.",
  "authors": [
    "Karen Gibson"
